 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAlbion Components Ltd                                   MASTER SERVICES\n221 Baker Street, M1 2AB Manchester, United Kingdom    AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB468182990\nReg No: GB-274077\n\nFROM                                                     BILL TO\nAlbion Components Ltd                                    Granite & Co Ltd\n221 Baker Street                                         221 Baker Street\nM1 2AB Manchester                                        BS1 5TR Bristol\nUnited Kingdom                                           United Kingdom\nVAT: GB468182990\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 18/04/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Albion Components Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Manchester (\"Party A\"), and Granite & Co\nLtd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Bristol (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Albion Components Ltd / Harry Whitfield\nParty B    Granite & Co Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nDate       18/04/2026",
